# The images install their own dependencies. A host node_modules copied over
# the top breaks the build (pnpm's links point at the host's store) and, built
# from Windows or macOS, carries native binaries for the wrong platform.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo

# Nothing secret goes into a build context: it ends up in the image layers or
# the builder's cache, and either can outlive the server.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.production.example

# Data, not source.
backups
certs
certbot-www
uploads
apps/api/uploads

.git
apps/web/e2e/screenshots
apps/web/test-results
apps/web/playwright-report
*.docx
